    <string name="tv_rest_offline_title">The TV’s IP control isn’t answering</string>
    <string name="tv_rest_offline_body">These settings go through the TV’s IP control. To turn it on, on the TV:\n\n1. Settings → Network &amp; Internet → Local network setup → IP control.\n2. Authentication: “Normal and Pre-Shared Key”.\n3. Pre-Shared Key: pick a code, then enter the same one here with “PSK”.\n4. Also turn on “Remote start”, so the TV answers in standby.\n\nThe TV and the phone must be on the same network.</string>
    <string name="tv_rest_unauthorized_title">The TV refuses the PSK</string>
    <string name="tv_rest_unauthorized_body">The TV answers, but the key in tutti doesn’t match (or there isn’t one). Check on the TV: Settings → Network &amp; Internet → Local network setup → IP control → Pre-Shared Key, then enter exactly the same here.</string>
